  "StockRole": "Industrial Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The UrbanMax is cheap and slow, built by MaxTech purely for urban defense without any thought given to crowd control or other non lethal options. It has decent enough firepower to handle most of the threats it's likely to face, but its industrial armor is no match for a real BattleMech. Then Orgus Industries rolled out the UrbanMech and outclassed it in every way, leaving the UrbanMax a cautionary tale in cutting corners.",
